notes[4]:
  - created_at: "2026-08-07T19:53:45.693Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Local verification before review: npm ci executed the production prepare hook; npm run release:check passed typecheck,59 tests,configured all-source coverage,production audit with zero vulnerabilities,pack dry-run,and deterministic changelog; bun run release:check passed the same gate. scripts/prepare-merge-driver.ts measured exact 100/100/100. Fresh packed-artifact acceptance against installed pm 2026.8.7 listed seven presets,showed/diffed/validated agent-workflow,applied it,created a real AgentRun item,and passed pm validate."
    edited_at: "2026-08-07T19:59:14.922Z"
  - created_at: "2026-08-07T19:53:45.693Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Release-readiness boundary: aggregate authored-source coverage is only 77.01/87.31/67.74 after adding the exact-covered lifecycle,not the required 100/100/100. Reachable history contains six identity pairs and host-path matches in 66 of 136 commits,while the current changed-file scan and bounded full-history credential scan found zero credential-pattern matches. pm-915f and pm-vsn5 remain open; no npm publication is authorized."
  - created_at: "2026-08-07T20:06:07.443Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Exact-head review round on e24f77c: CodeRabbit identified three valid findings and Greptile independently identified the mutable-action finding. All were fixed through audited PM mutations and immutable Windows action pins, individually upvoted/replied/resolved, and revalidated. Greptile reran at 5/5 with no blocking failure; Node 22,Node 26,and real Windows CI passed. CodeRabbit exact-head full rerun was rate-limited,Sourcery and Cubic were quota-limited,and Gemini was silent; those are limitations rather than approval."
  - created_at: "2026-08-07T20:09:18.045Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Final-head base reconciliation: while PR #46 was open,the daily release advanced main to v2026.08.07. GitHub correctly caught that the branch-local 2026.8.4 changelog placement differed from the merge ref. Merged origin/main without conflicts,retained the 2026.8.7 toolchain and lifecycle changes,and regenerated CHANGELOG.md so pm-xtq2 remains Unreleased rather than being attributed to the already-created tag."
